🚨 Students are commiting suicide and  CJP (@Cockroachisback) founding member Abhijeet Dipke (@abhijeet_dipke) and spokesperson Saurav Das (@SauravDassss) and Ashutosh Ranka (@AshutoshRanka) were in a 5 start hotel partying.

👉 Now it is (@ArvindKejriwal) Arvind Kejriwal's turn to walk the talk. He actively supported CJP (@Cockroachisback) protest and condemned the baton charge on the protesters.

👉 Will he now seek the resignation of Harjot Bains (@harjotbains), Dr Balbir Singh (@AAPbalbir) and CM Guru Dokhi Bhagwant Mann (@BhagwantMann)

👉 Punjab has witnessed repeated examination controversies: 

》May 2022 – PPSC Naib Tehsildar Recruitment Examination – 42,000 candidates affected.

》March 2023 – PSTET Examination – Around 100,000 candidates affected.

》February 2023 – PSEB Class 12 English Board Examination – 250,000 students affected.

》June 30, 2024 – PPSC Agriculture Development Officers Examination – 4,100 candidates affected.

》December 2025 – PSSSB Group B Combined Examination – Around 100,000 candidates affected.

》July 2026 – Pharmacy Officer Recruitment Examination – 7,000 candidates affected.

👉 Over the last four years, several examination controversies have raised serious concerns and jeopardized the future of thousands of Punjabi youth, yet there has been no accountability.

👉 If Union Ministers are expected to resign over serious issues, should the same standard not apply to AAP Ministers in Punjab

👉 Or is accountability meant only for the Central Government?

👉 Will Abhijeet Dipke (@abhijeet_dipke), Saurav Das (@SauravDassss) and Ashutosh Ranka  protest in Punjab?

👉 The Bhagwant Mann government, which has been trumpeting Mohalla Clinics (Aam Aadmi Clinics) across the country, has completely failed with its so-called 'world-class' health model. 

👉 Today, the staff of Mohalla Clinics, electricity workers (PSPCL), and sanitation workers are forced to strike on the streets.

👉 Punjab needs real development and solid governance, not false advertisements.

