#Sriram ,  Your Tweet is nothing but revalation of frustration. I have known all the Prime Ministes of the country, some of them intimately; but among all of them current PM
@narendramodi by far is the most effective person. During his 12 years of Prime Ministership of India he has led India to achieve not only stupendous economic growth but also great  name & fame for the country .India has reached greater heights during his period. He is the most revered and respected leader in the whole world. Many leaders of the world have extended unprecedented friendship with India.
#CockroachJanathaParty is the creation of anti-India & anti-
Hindu ecosystem. Anti-social elements from both within &
outside the country including 
Pappu & Kegrival have certainly conspired with theCockroaches
Reportedly Pappu mysteriously
disappeared from India for about two weeks & conspired with anti-Indian ecosystem abroad &.jumped into the protest and held the most despicable act of dharna in front of Prime Minister's official
residence . @Wangchuk66  unwarrantedly involved in the Jantar Mantar protest by  undertaking fasting at #CJP Jantar Mantar protest site.          Moreover a few thousand goons arranged by certain political outfits also intruded into the protest & indulged in stone pelting and violence against the police personnel.
The protest site was literd with stones and wooden logs. What is more food packets were freely distributed by food aggregates and the payment for which came from foreign nationals.
The Government of India acted cautiously. Otherwise it should have acted severely against the goons & unruly cockroaches.
The food aggregators should be severely dealt with for distributing food packets & water at the protest site .
     Now the Government should 
confiscate the passports and other IDs of the protests. 
AbijjetDipte should be expelled from the country.
